---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ServicePricing from '../../../../components/ServicePricing.astro';
import { getServicePricing } from '../../../../data/service-prices';
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations } from '../../../../i18n/utils';

const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(lang);
const pricing = getServicePricing('oven', 'sofia', lang);

const title = 'Cooker and Oven Repair in Sofia | RotoRem';
const description = 'Professional cooker and oven repair in Sofia - Fast in-home repair the same day - Quality guarantee - Contact us at 089 834 0982!';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-800 text-white py-16 mb-16">
      <div class="container max-w-4xl text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
          Cooker and Oven Repair in Sofia
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-blue-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
          Professional repair of electric ovens, cooktops, and hobs for homes and offices across Sofia.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-blue-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
          Visit and diagnostics in Sofia - 30 EUR
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a href="mailto:n.ivanov.ivanov@abv.bg" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-blue-600 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
            </svg>
            Send Email
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+359 89 834 0982" class="bg-amber-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-600 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            Call 089 834 0982
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container max-w-4xl">

      <!-- Service Highlights -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Why choose our cooker, oven, and cooktop repair service in Sofia?</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-blue-500 mx-auto"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-blue-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-blue-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M4 4h16v16H4z"></path>
                <path d="M8 8h8v8H8z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-blue-900 mb-3">Qualified electrical technicians</h3>
            <p class="text-blue-800">Certified specialists with experience in built-in ovens, free-standing cookers, hobs, and combined appliances.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-green-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-green-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 2v5"></path>
                <path d="M5.5 10.5l4.5 4.5 6-6 4.5 4.5"></path>
                <path d="M19 19H5"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-900 mb-3">Fast heating element replacement</h3>
            <p class="text-green-800">We carry heating elements, thermostats, and control boards for popular brands such as Gorenje, Bosch, Whirlpool, Indesit, Ariston, and Electrolux.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-amber-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-amber-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-900 mb-3">Warranty and testing</h3>
            <p class="text-amber-800">After each repair, we test all functions and provide warranty for the completed work and installed parts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-50 to-lime-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-lime-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-lime-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
                <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-lime-900 mb-3">Fair prices</h3>
            <p class="text-lime-800">Visit and diagnostics in Sofia - 30 EUR. Transparent pricing with no hidden fees for oven and cooktop repair.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Issues Section -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-200 p-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">Common issues we solve</h2>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-semibold">1</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Oven not heating</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600">We replace faulty bake, broil, or fan elements, relays, thermostats, and control boards to restore consistent heating.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-semibold">2</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Cooktop zones not responding</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600">Selector switches, touch controls, and induction modules are tested and replaced with calibrated components.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-semibold">3</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Oven not maintaining temperature</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600">We replace thermostats and temperature sensors, check insulation, and repair door seals.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-semibold">4</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Frequent tripping or error codes</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600">Comprehensive electrical diagnostics identify short circuits, overheating protection trips, or sensor failures that need correction.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {pricing && <ServicePricing pricing={pricing} accent="blue" />}

      <!-- Repair Process Section -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Oven repair process in Sofia</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-blue-500 mx-auto"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="text-center group">
            <div class="relative mb-6">
              <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <span class="text-2xl font-bold">1</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">You call us</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Call 089 834 0982 to book oven repair in Sofia.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center group">
            <div class="relative mb-6">
              <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-green-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <span class="text-2xl font-bold">2</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">We come to you</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Our technician arrives on time with all required tools and parts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center group">
            <div class="relative mb-6">
              <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-lg group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <span class="text-2xl font-bold">3</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">We repair</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700">We diagnose the issue and repair your oven the same day whenever possible.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Coverage Section -->
      <section class="mb-16 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">City-wide coverage in Sofia</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
          We travel to every part of Sofia - central neighbourhoods, south districts near Vitosha, western zones such as Lyulin and Obelya, and fast-growing areas around Mladost and Studentski Grad.
        </p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-gray-700">
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>City Center</li>
            <li>Lozenets</li>
            <li>Ivan Vazov</li>
            <li>Krasno Selo</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>Mladost</li>
            <li>Darvenitsa</li>
            <li>Dianabad</li>
            <li>Strelbishte</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>Lyulin</li>
            <li>Obelya</li>
            <li>Ovcha Kupel</li>
            <li>Gotse Delchev</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Final CTA -->
      <section class="text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-800 text-white p-12 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Need oven repair in Sofia?</h2>
        <p class="text-xl mb-8 text-blue-100">Call now for fast on-site repair!</p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mb-6">
          <a href="mailto:n.ivanov.ivanov@abv.bg" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-blue-600 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
            </svg>
            Send Email
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+359 89 834 0982" class="bg-amber-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-600 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            Call 089 834 0982
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="text-blue-100">
          <p class="text-sm">
            Visit and diagnostics: Sofia - 30 EUR | Quality guarantee | Service in Sofia
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- SEO Content Section -->
  <div class="rotorem-seo-text">
    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <p dir="ltr">Is the hob not turning on, the oven not baking, or the cooker stopping during use? These are problems that should not be postponed. We provide professional in-home repair of cookers, ovens, and hobs in Sofia. We respond quickly across the whole city and aim to restore your appliance during the first visit whenever possible.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">What cooker and oven problems we repair in Sofia</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">With constant use, kitchen appliances naturally wear out and faults appear. A common request is cooker repair when the oven does not reach temperature or bakes unevenly, usually related to a faulty heater or thermostat.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">We also see cases where the appliance does not start at all, often due to electronic faults, damaged cables, or blown protective components. For ceramic and induction models, when a zone does not respond or heats unevenly, we perform ceramic and induction hob repair.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">Another frequent issue is fan ovens where hot air is not distributed evenly, leading to undercooked food and the need for professional service.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">If you use built-in appliances, we repair built-in ovens as well, including faults in displays, programmers, or doors. When needed, we can also install a new unit after purchase.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">In addition to this service, you can rely on us for other home repairs. If your washer has problems, check our <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/washing-machine-repair/" style="text-decoration:none;">washing machine repair in Sofia</a>. For hot-water issues we also provide <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/boiler-repair/" style="text-decoration:none;">boiler repair</a>, and all city services are listed on our <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/" style="text-decoration:none;">Sofia white goods service page</a>.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">Cooker and oven brands we service</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">We work with all popular brands such as Gorenje, Bosch, Whirlpool, Beko, Indesit, and others. Whether it is a standard appliance or a modern built-in oven, we know the specifics of different models. We frequently repair Gorenje ovens, which helps us quickly identify common faults and provide accurate solutions.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">Sofia areas we cover</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">We provide cooker and oven repair in all Sofia districts and nearby areas up to 20 km. We service Mladost, Lyulin, Nadezhda, Druzhba, Studentski Grad, Lozenets, Krasno Selo, Ovcha Kupel, City Center, and more. Visits are scheduled flexibly so you can get help at a convenient time.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">How cooker repair works</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">The process starts with an on-site technician visit. We carry out detailed diagnostics to identify the exact cause of the issue. Then you receive a clear final quote with no unexpected costs.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">After approval, we begin repair immediately, and in many cases the issue is fixed during the first visit. We finish with a full functional test to ensure safe and normal operation. The goal is to return your cooker, hob, or oven to working condition without unnecessary waiting or extra visits.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">Why choose RotoRem for cooker and oven repair</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">Customers choose us when they need a safe and fast solution. We work on-site, saving time and transport effort. We have long-term experience with many appliance models. We use quality parts and provide warranty for completed repairs.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">Pricing is clear with no hidden fees, and communication is direct and honest. If you need cooker installation or repair in Sofia, <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/contact/" style="text-decoration:none;">contact us</a> and request a visit at your preferred time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>


